   "reproduction": {
    "command": "bun $TMPDIR/adj/c1.ts  (starts runProcess(['/bin/sh','-c','sleep 1']) in cwd; while it runs, the script itself, not the invocation, double-forks an orphan /bin/sleep 30 with env {} in the same cwd; it awaits the invocation and then checks the orphan). Also: bun -e 'import {hiddenDarwinProcessMember as member} from \"./src/util/processes-darwin.ts\"; console.log(member(42,new Map([[42,1]]),new Set(),100,[process.cwd()],()=>101,()=>({path:process.cwd()})))'",
