   "evidence": "The probe launched a detached Bun worker inside the invocation cwd with `env:{FOO:'bar'}`, then waited for its launcher to exit before ending the invocation. The worker survived and kept writing. Its replacement environment removes the markers, its new session removes group/session membership, and orphaning removes the proven ancestor chain. HEAD only executes `hidden.add(pid)` when `offset === length`; therefore this visible, nonempty environment excludes the worker from cwd-based fallback at lines 197\u2013199. Base also misses it. Unlike C2, this failure occurs inside the captured cwd because the fallback is never applied."
